                  - img [ref=e185]\n                  - generic [ref=e188]: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                - paragraph [ref=e189]: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e190] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e191]\n            - generic [ref=e193]:\n              - generic [ref=e194]:\n                - img \"剪纸\" [ref=e195]\n                - generic [ref=e197]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e198]:\n                  - heading \"剪纸\" [level=3] [ref=e199]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e200]: Paper Cutting\n              - generic [ref=e201]:\n                - generic [ref=e202]:\n                  - img [ref=e203]\n                  - generic [ref=e206]: 陕西 · 黄土高原\n                - paragraph [ref=e207]: 剪纸是中国最古老的民间艺术之一，用剪刀或刻刀在纸上剪刻花纹，寓意吉祥美好。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e208] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/paper-cutting\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e209]\n            - generic [ref=e211]:\n              - generic [ref=e212]:\n                - img \"京剧\" [ref=e213]\n                - generic [ref=e215]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e216]:\n                  - heading \"京剧\" [level=3] [ref=e217]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e218]: Peking Opera\n              - generic [ref=e219]:\n                - generic [ref=e220]:\n                  - img [ref=e221]\n                  - generic [ref=e224]: 北京 · 京城古韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e225]: 京剧是中国影响最大的戏曲剧种，被誉为\"国粹\"，以唱念做打的表演方式闻名于世。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e226] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/peking-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e227]\n            - generic [ref=e229]:\n              - generic [ref=e230]:\n                - img \"昆曲\" [ref=e231]\n                - generic [ref=e233]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e234]:\n                  - heading \"昆曲\" [level=3] [ref=e235]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e236]: Kunqu Opera\n              - generic [ref=e237]:\n                - generic [ref=e238]:\n                  - img [ref=e239]\n                  - generic [ref=e242]: 江苏 · 姑苏雅韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e243]: 昆曲是中国最古老的戏曲剧种之一，被誉为\"百戏之祖\"，以典雅细腻的表演著称。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e244] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/kunqu-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e245]\n            - generic [ref=e247]:\n              - generic [ref=e248]:\n                - img \"书法\" [ref=e249]\n                - generic [ref=e251]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e252]:\n                  - heading \"书法\" [level=3] [ref=e253]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e254]: Chinese Calligraphy\n              - generic [ref=e255]:\n                - generic [ref=e256]:\n                  - img [ref=e257]\n                  - generic [ref=e260]: 安徽 · 神州墨韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e261]: 书法是中国特有的艺术形式，以毛笔书写汉字，融合了文字、绘画与哲学的精髓。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e262] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/chinese-calligraphy\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e263]\n            - generic [ref=e265]:\n              - generic [ref=e266]:\n                - img \"苏绣\" [ref=e267]\n                - generic [ref=e269]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e270]:\n                  - heading \"苏绣\" [level=3] [ref=e271]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e272]: Suzhou Embroidery\n              - generic [ref=e273]:\n                - generic [ref=e274]:\n                  - img [ref=e275]\n                  - generic [ref=e278]: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                - paragraph [ref=e279]: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e280] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e281]\n            - generic [ref=e283]:\n              - generic [ref=e284]:\n                - img \"宜兴紫砂\" [ref=e285]\n                - generic [ref=e287]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e288]:\n                  - heading \"宜兴紫砂\" [level=3] [ref=e289]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e290]: Yixing Purple Clay\n              - generic [ref=e291]:\n                - generic [ref=e292]:\n                  - img [ref=e293]\n                  - generic [ref=e296]: 江苏 · 太湖之滨\n                - paragraph [ref=e297]: 宜兴紫砂壶以独特的紫砂泥料制成，造型古朴典雅，是中国传统茶文化的重要载体。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e298] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/yixing-teapot\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e299]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e301]:\n      - generic [ref=e302]:\n        - generic [ref=e303]:\n          - generic [ref=e304]:\n            - generic [ref=e305]:\n              - generic [ref=e307]: 遗\n              - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=3] [ref=e309]\n            - paragraph [ref=e310]: 致力于保护和传承中国非物质文化遗产，让千年文化在数字时代焕发新的生机。\n          - generic [ref=e311]:\n            - heading \"探索分类\" [level=4] [ref=e312]\n            - list [ref=e313]:\n              - listitem [ref=e314]:\n                - link \"传统工艺\" [ref=e315] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e316]:\n                - link \"传统表演\" [ref=e317] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e318]:\n                - link \"民俗活动\" [ref=e319] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e320]:\n                - link \"传统美术\" [ref=e321] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n          - generic [ref=e322]:\n            - heading \"了解更多\" [level=4] [ref=e323]\n            - list [ref=e324]:\n              - listitem [ref=e325]:\n                - link \"关于我们\" [ref=e326] [cursor=pointer]